nflicting use. Reserve support use without acquiring ownership or granting permission. Do not operate on another participant's materials or require their assistance without their independent communication and action.\\\\nTrack processId, actor, source revision, method/model version, exact inputs, reservations, paid rounds, remaining work, condition changes, action events and resulting identities. Revalidate access, ownership, survival, support/tool condition and energy before each atomic work step; conflicts pause before further charges. No unattended work. Interruption preserves paid progress and every actual deformation, exposure and fragment; resume uses the same process and live state, never reruns completed work. Cancellation releases unused reservations once; it does not undo damage, recreate a whole nut, refund spent energy/time or return transformed material twice. Death ends active work and releases locks under existing ownership/death rules, leaving surviving matter at its actual location; no automatic delivery or repair. Unspent reserved material remains accounted for and is released without duplication. Existing ageing continues during all real study, work and pauses; development/review waiting advances no time.\\\\nConservation: never retain an edible whole nut while also minting its contents. On actual separation, mark the original as transformed and link all resulting portions, loose debris and retained assembly to its single conserved source unit. Use an exact supported source-fraction ledger, not invented mass or additional nutrition; do not round tiny fragments into extra stock. If fractional inventory is unsupported, retain an assembly with internally accounted portions rather than invent pickup units. No unexplained disappearance of debris. Record displaced or lost-from-custody portions at their actual positions. Output only genuinely exposed visual evidence: source/process IDs, tick, viewing conditions, visible features and uncertainty. Unexposed interior stays unknown. A failed or partial attempt records its actual result, including any damage, without asserting an opening. Inspection costs one round/0.2 energy and observes accessible current state only. No ongoing powered process, maintenance bonus, regeneration, edibility certification, health, satiety, nutrition, comfort or preparation requirement is created. Any newly necessary containment or maintenance is a reported limitation, not automatically performed work.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Lin must personally study for two actual rounds at 0.2 energy per round; registration and learning completion award no experience benefit. Assess functional results separately from subjective benefit. Only genuinely verified, personally applicable information—including a paid informative failure—may use the existing grounded-understanding rule, if its implementation is present: short source amount 0.8, aggregate cap 1, duration 8 rounds, cooldown 12 rounds, maintained gain 0.035 with decay 0.0015 per round. Otherwise award zero rather than create a reward rule. Deduplicate by specimen, property and actual state across exterior assessment, probe, this trial and equivalent observations; unchanged repetitions and merely identifying an unimplemented mechanism do not qualify. Familiar legitimate practice can be applicable but supplies no automatic benefit. No social or pleasure award without a separately supported real event. Enforce established rules in code; never modify protected reward accounts, budget, goals or permissions. No physical comfort is granted and basic nutrition is unchanged.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Emit observable assessment, contact, pause, damage, exposure and completion events only when they occur. Retain reusable visual metadata including source identity/revision, processId, method/model version, tick, actual location, geometry and uncertainty, visible covering state, exposed-region mask, fragment provenance and state. Reuse exterior rendering metadata when applicable. Before actual exposure the interior remains occluded; a prerequisite report or unsuccessful attempt must not show a split shell, kernel, tool, new stock or success animation. Partial damage is shown only where physically produced. Public visuals reveal only externally visible changes; detailed personal findings remain private unless independently communicated. Annotation overlays are explicitly nonphysical and confer no support, containment or functional effect.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

